# LCExtForward opt-in list.
# Put this file next to LCExtForward.dylib in LiveContainer's GLOBAL tweak folder.
# One app per line: either the .app name or its CFBundleIdentifier. "*" = all apps.
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Empty file = nothing is converted or forwarded.
# After adding an app, re-sign it in LiveContainer once.

com.willfaust.madeora.app
com.minh-ton.Reynard
